# Pokemon Emerald (USA, Europe): the intro to the moving van, then the Start menu and SAVE (gate G7, saves: the 128 KB Flash chip).
# The same taps as the route into the house until frame 5,800, the van runs, then Start (6,700), Down twice, A (the prompt), A on YES at 7,500: 'Saving... Don't turn off the power', the 131,072-byte Flash file is written by about frame 8,000.
# For the delivered player with no save; the frame limit is 8,800.
# frame,keyinput_active_low (the value holds until the next line)
